             PGM (&#DATE &PASS)
             DCL        &#DATE  *DEC   LEN(8 0)
             DCL        &PASS   *CHAR  LEN(1)
             DCL        &DATECH *CHAR  LEN(8)

             CHGVAR     &PASS ' '
             CHGVAR     &DATECH &#DATE
             CVTDAT     &DATECH &DATECH  *YYMD *MDYY *NONE
             MONMSG     CPF0000 EXEC(CHGVAR &PASS 'F')

ENDPGM
